@startuml SEC-02
skinparam dpi 135
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title SEC-02 Iniciar sesión (CU-02 / API-02)
autonumber
actor Portal
participant AuthController as C
participant AuthService as S
participant UsuarioRepository as R
participant JwtService as J
Portal -> C : POST /api/v1/auth/login\nLoginRequest (DTO-03)
C -> S : login(request) [SRV-02]
S -> R : findByEmail(email normalizado)
R --> S : Optional<Usuario>
S -> S : PasswordEncoder.matches(password, hash)
alt inexistente o contraseña incorrecta [RN-08]
 S --> Portal : 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS (mensaje genérico)
else contraseña correcta y cuenta INACTIVA [RN-04]
 S --> Portal : 403 USER_INACTIVE
else cuenta ACTIVA
 S -> J : generarToken(id, rol) [RN-09]
 J --> S : HS256: sub=id, role, iat, exp
 S --> C : LoginResponse (DTO-04)
 C --> Portal : 200 token, tipo, expiraEn, usuarioId, nombre, rol
end
note over C,S : Campos inválidos: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR.
@enduml
